#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:110
msgid "Inpainting Photograph Tool"
msgstr "Ferramenta de Pintura Interior de Fotografias"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:111
msgid "You need to select a region to inpaint to use this tool"
msgstr "Necesita escoller unha rexión a pintar para usar esta ferramenta"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:128 imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:147
#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:174
msgid "Photograph Inpainting"
msgstr "Pintura Interior de Fotografias"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:132
msgid "&Save As..."
msgstr "&Guardar Como..."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:133
msgid "&Load..."
msgstr "&Carregar..."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:137
msgid "<p>Reset all filter parameters to their default values."
msgstr ""
"<p>Reiniciar todos os parámetros do filtro aos seus valores predefinidos."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:138
msgid "<p>Load all filter parameters from settings text file."
msgstr ""
"<p>Carregar todos os parámetros do filtro a partir do ficheiro de "
"configurazón."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:139
msgid "<p>Save all filter parameters to settings text file."
msgstr "<p>Guardar todos os parámetros do filtro nun ficheiro de configurazón."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:149
msgid "A digiKam image plugin to inpaint a photograph."
msgstr "Un plugin de digiKam para pintar interiormente unha fotografia."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:155
msgid "Author and maintainer"
msgstr "Autoria e mantimento"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:158
msgid "CImg library"
msgstr "Biblioteca CImg"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:161
msgid "Feedback and plugin polishing"
msgstr "Reaczóns e polimento do plugin"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:167
msgid "Plugin Handbook"
msgstr "Manual do plugin"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:184
msgid "Preset"
msgstr "Predefinizón"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:192
msgid "Visit CImg library website"
msgstr "Páxina Web da biblioteca CImg"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:194
msgid "Filtering type:"
msgstr "Tipo de filtraxe:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:197
msgid "None"
msgstr "Nengun"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:198
msgid "Remove Small Artefact"
msgstr "Eliminar os Artefactos Pequenos"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:199
msgid "Remove Medium Artefact"
msgstr "Eliminar os Artefactos Meios"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:200
msgid "Remove Large Artefact"
msgstr "Eliminar os Artefactos Grandes"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:201
msgid ""
"<p>Select here the filter preset to use for photograph restoration:"
"<p><b>None</b>: Most common values. Puts settings to default.<p><b>Remove "
"Small Artefact</b>: inpaint small image artefact like image glitch."
"<p><b>Remove Medium Artefact</b>: inpaint medium image artefact.<p><b>Remove "
"Large Artefact</b>: inpaint image artefact like unwanted object.<p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Escolla aqui os axustes do filtro a usar na restaurazón das fotografias:"
"<p><b>Nengun</b>: Os valores mais comuns. Coloca a configurazón no estado "
"predefinido.<p><b>Eliminar os Artefactos Pequenos</b>: pinta os pequenos "
"artefactos da imaxe, como os pequenos defeitos de imaxe.<p><b>Eliminar os "
"Artefactos Meios</b>: pinta os artefactos meios de imaxe.<p><b>Eliminar os "
"Artefactos Grandes</b>: pinta os artefactos grandes, como os obxectos "
"indesexados.<p>"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:213
msgid "<p>This is the current percentage of the task completed."
msgstr "<p>Esta é a porcentaxe da tarefa actualmente completa."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:221
msgid "Smoothing"
msgstr "Suavizazón"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:223
msgid "Detail preservation:"
msgstr "Preservazón dos detalles:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:228
msgid ""
"<p>Preservation of details to set the sharpening level of the small features "
"in the target image. Higher values leave details sharp."
msgstr ""
"<p>A preservazón dos detalles serve para definir o nível de afiamento dos "
"pequenos detalles na imaxe de destino. Os valores mais altos deixan os "
"detalles ben definidos."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:234
msgid "Anisotropy:"
msgstr "Anisotropia:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:239
msgid ""
"<p>Anisotropic (directional) modifier of the details. Keep it small for "
"Gaussian noise."
msgstr ""
"<p>Modificador anisotrópico (direccional) dos detalles. Deixe-o baixo para "
"obter un ruído Gausiano."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:243
msgid "Smoothing:"
msgstr "Suavizazón:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:248
msgid ""
"<p>Total smoothing power: if Detail Factor sets the relative smoothing and "
"Gradient Factor the direction, Time Step sets the overall effect."
msgstr ""
"<p>Poténcia de suavizazón total: se o Factor de Detalle define a suavizazón "
"relativa e o Factor Gradiente a direczón, o Paso Temporal define o efeito "
"global."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:253
msgid "Regularity:"
msgstr "Regularidade:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:258
msgid ""
"<p>This value controls the smoothing regularity of the target image. Do not "
"use an high value here, else the target image will be completely blurred."
msgstr ""
"<p>Este valor controla a regularidade de suavizazón da imaxe final. Non use "
"un valor alto aqui, en caso contrário a imaxe final quedará completamente "
"borrada."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:264
msgid "Iterations:"
msgstr "Iterazóns:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:269
msgid "<p>Sets the number of times the filter is applied on the target image."
msgstr "<p>Define o número de veces que o filtro é aplicado na imaxe final."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:277
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "Configurazón Avanzada"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:279
msgid "Angular step:"
msgstr "Paso angular:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:284
msgid ""
"<p>Set here the angular integration step in degrees in analogy to anisotropy."
msgstr ""
"<p>Defina aqui o paso de integrazón angular en graus, en analoxia coa "
"anisotropia."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:288
msgid "Integral step:"
msgstr "Paso integral:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:293
msgid "<p>Set here the spatial integral step. Stay below 1."
msgstr "<p>Defina aqui o paso integral espacial. Defina-o como menor que 1."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:297
msgid "Gaussian:"
msgstr "Gausiano:"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:302
msgid "<p>Set here the precision of the Gaussian function."
msgstr "<p>Defina aqui a precisión da funzón gausiana."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:306
msgid "Use linear interpolation"
msgstr "Usar a interpolazón linear"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:307
msgid "<p>Enable this option to quench the last bit of quality (slow)."
msgstr ""
"<p>Active esta opzón para aproveitar o último ponto de calidade (lento)."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:310
msgid "Normalize photograph"
msgstr "Normalizar a fotografia"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:311
msgid "<p>Enable this option to process an output image normalization."
msgstr "<p>Active esta opzón para procesar unha normalizazón na imaxe final."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:556
msgid "InPainting"
msgstr "Pintura Interior"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:581
msgid "Photograph Inpainting Settings File to Load"
msgstr "Carregando o Arquivo de Configurazón da Pintura Interior"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:593
msgid "\"%1\" is not a Photograph Inpainting settings text file."
msgstr ""
"\"%1\" non é un ficheiro de configurazón de pintura interior de fotografias."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:614
msgid "Cannot load settings from the Photograph Inpainting text file."
msgstr ""
"Non foi posíbel carregar a configurazón do ficheiro de pintura interior de "
"fotografias."

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:623
msgid "Photograph Inpainting Settings File to Save"
msgstr "Guardando Arquivo de Configurazón da Pintura Interior"

#: imageeffect_inpainting.cpp:645
msgid "Cannot save settings to the Photograph Inpainting text file."
msgstr ""
"Non foi posíbel guardar a configurazón no ficheiro de texto de pintura "
"interior de fotografias."

#: imageplugin_inpainting.cpp:42
msgid "Inpainting..."
msgstr "Pintura Interior..."

#: imageplugin_inpainting.cpp:46
msgid ""
"This filter can be used to inpaint a part in a photo. Select a region to "
"inpaint to use this option."
msgstr ""
"Este filtro pode ser usado para pintar interiormente unha parte dunha "
"fotografia. Escolla a rexión a pintar para usar esta opzón."

